# Toffoli runs deterministic-only with no key. The gated, marked LLM judge —
# used ONLY on the context-dependent residual the rules abstain on — needs a key.
# Without it, the classifier still runs end to end (deterministic floor only).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the judge model (default: claude-haiku-4-5).
# TOFFOLI_JUDGE_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5
